        <item>
            <title>Annotake 0.3.0 (185)</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:03:26 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>185</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Annotake can now email you about security fixes and important changes, if you want. The email is optional: skip it and everything works the same. Also new: Annotake shows in the Dock while its windows are open, and the email field suggests a fix for likely typos.</p>]]></description>
