        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Annotake 0.2.0 (132)</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:27:35 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>132</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Long recordings no longer close Annotake when you drag their card. In a card's filmstrip, click a frame or press Space to see it full screen: ← and → flip through the frames, ⌫ removes or restores one, and Return applies your changes.</p>]]></description>
